{"name":"Gardening","hex":"#acba8d","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"gardening","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The process or action of cultivating the soil, particularly in a garden; the care of a garden; horticulture.","Any process of care, maintenance, or curation, especially digitally."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of garden"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/gardening"}],"entries":[{"title":"Gardening","blocks":[{"text":"Gardening is the process of growing plants for their vegetables, fruits, flowers, herbs, or ornamental purposes within a designated space. Gardens fulfill a wide assortment of purposes, notably the production of aesthetically pleasing areas, medicines, cosmetics, dyes, foods, poisons, wildlife habitats, and saleable goods. People often partake in gardening for its therapeutic, health, educational, cultural, philosophical, environmental, and religious benefits."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Cementerio%2C_Tulc%C3%A1n%2C_Ecuador%2C_2015-07-21%2C_DD_60.JPG/330px-Cementerio%2C_Tulc%C3%A1n%2C_Ecuador%2C_2015-07-21%2C_DD_60.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gardening","wikidata":"Q124946"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Hayes-Valley-Farm_by_Zoey-Kroll_fava-hillside.jpg/500px-Hayes-Valley-Farm_by_Zoey-Kroll_fava-hillside.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Hayes-Valley-Farm_by_Zoey-Kroll_fava-hillside.jpg/1280px-Hayes-Valley-Farm_by_Zoey-Kroll_fava-hillside.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Hayes-Valley-Farm_by_Zoey-Kroll_fava-hillside.jpg/500px-Hayes-Valley-Farm_by_Zoey-Kroll_fava-hillside.jpg?utm_sour